# Frontend Architecture

## Directory Structure

```
app/frontend/
├── entrypoints/       # Vite entry points
├── layouts/           # Persistent layouts (AuthLayout, ProjectLayout)
├── pages/             # Inertia page components — mirror Rails controller paths
│   ├── Auth/
│   ├── Company/
│   │   └── Sessions/  # Index.tsx, New.tsx, Show.tsx
│   ├── Onboarding/
│   ├── Profile/
│   └── Projects/
│       ├── Sessions/
│       ├── Workflows/
│       └── ...
├── shared/
│   ├── components/    # Reusable form/UI components (SessionNewForm, etc.)
│   ├── resources/     # Domain CRUD panels (assets, skills, tools, repos)
│   ├── lib/           # Utilities (apiFetch, actionCableConsumer, hooks)
│   ├── ui/            # Shell, sidebar, header, shared types
│   ├── config/        # App configuration
│   └── theme/         # Mantine theme overrides
└── types/
    └── generated/     # Auto-generated TS types from Alba resources (Typelizer)
```

## Key Rules

- **Pages** map 1:1 to Rails controller actions: `Company/Sessions/Index.tsx` → `Web::Company::SessionsController#index`
- **Shared components** go in `shared/components/` when used by multiple pages
- **Resource panels** (CRUD for a model) go in `shared/resources/<model>/`
- **Generated types** in `types/generated/` are auto-generated — never edit manually
- **Co-locate** CSS modules with their component: `Show.tsx` + `Show.module.css`
- Page props interfaces are defined in the page file, not in a separate types file

## Imports

```tsx
import { AuthLayout } from 'layouts/AuthLayout';
import { apiFetch } from 'shared/lib/apiFetch';
import { SessionNewForm } from 'shared/components/SessionNewForm';
import type { AgentType, SharedProps } from 'shared/ui/types';
import type { TerminalSession } from 'types/generated';
```
